<title>USA: New York physical copper market - June 4.</title>
<headline>New York physical copper market - June 4.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on COMEX settlement prices, merchant copper cathodes for June shipment were quoted at a nominal 118.35 to 119.10 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Dealers quoted No.2 scrap copper at a nominal 98.50 cents per lb, unchanged from June 3rd.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
